 <iati-activity default-currency="USD" hierarchy="1" iati-activities:version="2.02" linked-data-uri="https://www.iadb.org/en/project/CH-L1009" xml:lang="EN" xmlns:iati-activities="http://d-portal.org/xmlns/iati-activities" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <iati-identifier>XI-IATI-IADB-CH-L1009</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento Institucional DIRECON</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening DIRECON</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chile has asked the Bank&apos;s support to: (a) ensure consistency among diverse commitments it has made in international trade accords and instigate their implementation; (b) strengthen its capacity to design and implement policies and tools to encourage trade in accordance with the regulatory framework agreed in the OMC; (c) develop various information systems to support monitoring and implementation of trade accords and improve statistical analysis capacity and scenario formulations to ensure favorable insertion in specific markets; and (d) optimize its regulatory framework to attract external investment and promote international trade, as well as further simplify its trade management procedures.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Proyecto es contribuir a mejorar la competitividad de los bienes y servicios transables del pas y el intercambio comercial. Especficamente, la operacin contribuira a modernizar y fortalecer la capacidad de la Direccin General de Relaciones Econmicas Internacionales del Ministerio de Relaciones Exteriores para: (i) apoyar el cumplimiento y efectiva aplicacin de los compromisos asumidos en el mbito de los acuerdos comerciales bilaterales, regionales y multilaterales; y (ii) desarrollar y aplicar polticas, programas y estrategias que permitan el aprovechamiento de las oportunidades que surgen de los acuerdos internacionales suscritos.</narrative>
  </description>
